# enterprise-level-search-and-rag

Enterprise search and RAG workspace with a separate FastAPI backend and React + TypeScript frontend.

## Stack

- Backend: FastAPI
- Frontend: React + TypeScript with Vite
- Vector store: Qdrant
- Document store: SQLite
- Retrieval: hybrid BM25 + vector search

## Structure

```text
.
├─ README.md
├─ pyproject.toml
├─ .env.example
├─ Dockerfile
├─ docker-compose.yml
├─ frontend/
